            "review_title": "Review at Maya Rooftop Bar",
            "review_text": "Jan J\n6 contributions\n0\nJul 2025\nAfter a 14 day stay at Silverland May Hotel in Ho Chi Minh City, I have had a host of great experiences. Of the biggest have actually been my numerous stays at the Maya Roof Top bar at the rooftop pool of the hotel. Here started my day after breakfast with a planning caffe, where Quy big ready every morning and with a nik knew the order 😊 The pool bar was also visited diligently to digest the experiences of the day with a cool beer and finally a coffee and a whisky to end the evening with. Good atmosphere, fine evening arrangements for every taste, clean, nice and well-maintained pool and large selection in the bar. Absolutely most important of all, however, was the staff, which surpassed everything in service, smiles, attention and kindness. Everyone as one!\n\nSo if you’re visiting Southeast Asia, you should stop by Maya Rooftop Bar in Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Danish\nShow original\nWritten July 24, 2025",
