            "review_title": "Review at Maya Rooftop Bar",
            "review_text": "Jackie Trương\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nA lovely night at Maya Bar!\nJul 2025 • Friends\nI visited Maya Rooftop Bar with a friend over the weekend and honestly, it was such a great experience. The view from the rooftop is stunning – you get this beautiful city skyline, a cool breeze, and the pool lights make the whole place feel like a little oasis above Saigon.\n\nThe cocktails were delicious and beautifully presented. I had the Mojito – super refreshing with a nice twist. My friend tried the Mirage Margarita and loved it. The music was chill, not too loud, so we could actually talk and enjoy the vibe.\n\nWhat really stood out was the staff – super friendly, attentive, and professional without being too formal. We felt genuinely welcomed and taken care of the entire evening.\n\nAll in all: beautiful setting, great drinks, and warm service. I’ll definitely come back, and I’d totally recommend Maya if you're looking for a stylish yet relaxing place to hang out or go on a date.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 14, 2025",
